--- !u!114 &329324237
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 329324236}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 3 | Ders 13 | Kuvvetler"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin sonundaki durumdur. ZiplayanKarakter beti\u011Fi Karakter
    nesnesine eklenmi\u015Ftir. Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n ve Game penceresine t\u0131klay\u0131n.
    A ve D tu\u015Flar\u0131 y\xFCr\xFCt\xFCr, bo\u015Fluk tu\u015Fu z\u0131plat\u0131r.\n\n\xD6nce
    arkadaki \xFC\xE7 k\xFCpe ayn\u0131 kuvveti uygulay\u0131p k\xFCtlenin ivmeye
    etkisini izliyoruz. Sonra \xF6ndeki k\xFCp\xFC, Rigidbody kullanmadan, kuvvetlerle
    y\xFCr\xFCyen ve z\u0131playan bir karaktere d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCyoruz.
    Z\u0131plama y\xFCksekli\u011Fini metre cinsinden veriyor, gereken h\u0131z\u0131
    koda hesaplat\u0131yoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Ders13_Baslangic sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n ve Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Arkadaki
    \xFC\xE7 k\xFCpe ayn\u0131 kuvvet uygulan\u0131r. \xDCzerlerindeki yaz\u0131lardan
    k\xFCtleleri ve ivmeleri okuyun. K\xFCtlesi k\xFC\xE7\xFCk olan \xF6ne ge\xE7er.
    Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  - "Project penceresinde Betikler klas\xF6r\xFCndeki ZiplayanKarakter beti\u011Fini
    a\xE7\u0131n. Update fonksiyonunda kuvvetlerin topland\u0131\u011F\u0131 sat\u0131rlar\u0131,
    ivmenin hesapland\u0131\u011F\u0131 sat\u0131r\u0131 ve z\u0131plama sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131
    bulun."
  - "ZiplayanKarakter beti\u011Fini Karakter nesnesine ekleyin. Karakterin 2 metre
    \xFCzerinde sar\u0131 bir \xE7izgi belirir. Yaz\u0131da z\u0131plama h\u0131z\u0131
    8.94 g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr."
  - "Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n ve Game penceresine t\u0131klay\u0131n. D tu\u015Funu
    bas\u0131l\u0131 tutun. H\u0131z yakla\u015F\u0131k 6.67 de\u011Ferinde sabitlenir.
    Tu\u015Fu b\u0131rak\u0131n. Karakter kayarak durur."
  - "Bo\u015Fluk tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n. Karakter sar\u0131 \xE7izgiye kadar y\xFCkselir.
    Yaz\u0131daki ula\u015F\u0131lan y\xFCkseklik de\u011Ferini okuyun."
  - "Play modundayken Ziplama Yuksekligi de\u011Ferini 4 yap\u0131n ve z\u0131play\u0131n.
    Sonra Yercekimi de\u011Ferini 40 yap\u0131n ve yeniden z\u0131play\u0131n. Karakter
    ayn\u0131 y\xFCksekli\u011Fe daha k\u0131sa s\xFCrede \xE7\u0131kar."
  - "Kutle de\u011Ferini 4 yap\u0131n. Karakter daha yava\u015F h\u0131zlan\u0131r
    ama z\u0131plama y\xFCksekli\u011Fi de\u011Fi\u015Fmez."
  - "Surtunme de\u011Ferini \xF6nce 1, sonra 20 yap\u0131n ve y\xFCr\xFCy\xFCn. Play
    modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n."
  kendinDene:
  - "Yurume Kuvveti de\u011Ferini 80 yap\u0131n. En y\xFCksek h\u0131z ka\xE7 oluyor?
    Hesaplay\u0131p yaz\u0131daki de\u011Ferle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n."
  - "KuvvetOrnegi alt\u0131ndaki Kutle4 nesnesinde Rigidbody bile\u015Feninin Mass
    de\u011Ferini 8 yap\u0131n. \u0130vme ka\xE7 oluyor?"
  - "Kutle1 nesnesinde Rigidbody bile\u015Feninin Linear Damping de\u011Ferini 2
    yap\u0131n. K\xFCp\xFCn h\u0131z\u0131 nas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Fiyor?"
  - "ZiplayanKarakter beti\u011Finde s\xFCrt\xFCnme sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 silin.
    Karakter nas\u0131l davran\u0131yor?"
